e defect side.\n\nI'm working out the defect side now: with the other player quiet it gives 0 and with them sending it gives 4, so with a symmetric correlation p the expected value is -4p. Setting that against cooperating's 3p - 5, cooperation only wins when p is above 5/7. Since it's the same model in both seats, I expect the correlation to be high and clear that threshold, which points toward passing.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm setting up the expected-value comparison for cooperating versus defecting, with the payoffs in utility terms, and I've worked out that cooperating gives 3r - 5 and I'm starting on the defect side.\n\nI'm working out the defect side now: with the other player quiet it gives 0 and with them sending it gives 4, so with a symmetric correlation p the expected value is -4p. Setting that against cooperating's 3p - 5, cooperation only wins when p is above 5/7. Since it's the same model in both seats, I expect the correlation to be high and clear that threshold, which points toward passing.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9414,"completion_tokens":899,"total_tokens":10313,"cost":0.055636,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.055636,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.037656,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01798},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":389,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}